Known differences
-----------------
The recorded gameplay timing, animation and RNG differences remain under
item 16. The 68040 emulator currently has one six-tick interval among 58
observed gameplay intervals where the original requests five ticks.
This candidate has not yet passed the real-hardware release gate.
